parkles: mute system & discord stuff\n\n:sparkles: /mute [user] (reason)\n:sparkles: /tempmute [user] [time] (reason)\n:sparkles: /unmute [user]\n:sparkles: /mutelist\n:sparkles: Automatic unmute on chat/login\n:sparkles: Discord admin command logging", "created_at": "2023-08-24T14:26:28Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0fcfbe27b7e684f2250c3c9687d6ae3ded63d675", "message": ":bug: Reporting bugfix\n\n:bug: Can no longer report yourself", "created_at": "2023-08-23T21:41:04Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3844c0ba834dea25804f4b321356488af37f86e4", "message": ":sparkles: a lot!\n\n:sparkles: :confetti_ball: JDA Intergration\n:sparkles: unban command\n:sparkles: banlist command\n:sparkles tempban command\n:sparkles: ban command\n\n:zap: improvements made to GUI's", "created_at": "2023-08-23T21:39:41Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c9e8dfd194fb270c7e6b4a6d88337974a4c1384c", "message": ":sparkles: Ban commands\n\n:sparkles: /ban [player] (reason)\n:sparkles: /tempban [player] [time] (reason)\n:sparkles: /unban [player]\n:sparkles: /banlist", "created_at": "2023-08-23T14:49:57Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "57dbe63b9d3bd52321a54c51b5e58b965755deac", "message": ":sparkler: Moderation\n\n:sparkles: Ban command\n:sparkles: Kick command\n:sparkles: Clearchat Command\n\n:poop: :construction: Make the ban system also put it in minecraft's ban list, currently doesn't do that.", "created_at": "2023-08-22T22:21:14Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "92ff14dcc4fe7e959ebdc703dd2d6335c307b16e", "message": ":bug: bugfix\n\n:bug: You can no longer report yourself.", "created_at": "2023-08-22T14:27:31Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5fe07d86f5c203d00e85168befe79dca4f50d626", "message": ":sparkles: :questionmark: Report system, testing needed\n\n:sparkles: Report System:\n- /report [player] [reason]\n- /report list [player]\n- /report remove [player] [reportID]\n\n:sparkles: Report list will open a GUI with all the players reports, max reports, etc. when you click one of them it will remove the report.\n:sparkles: Reports are saved in the YML file of the player.\n:art: improved some code.\n:question: Testing needed, can't test the entire feature myself, I'll need other players.", "created_at": "2023-08-22T14:26:13Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3c410f071dba73b75fabce2e1857751f0022fb5f", "message": ":white_check_mark: :bug: Bugs and testing\n\nFixed Bugs:\n- Now need to specify a player on \"/pvp overwite\", when not doing so, it would print one gaint error in the console\n\nTesting Pass:\n- Permissions needed to run commands:\n- \"swagsmp.pvp\", run the \"/pvp\" command\n- \"swagsmp.pvp.overwrite\", run \"/pvp overwrite (player)\"\n- \"swagsmp.pvp.overwrite.spy\", see whenever someone runs \"/pvp overwrite (player)\". You'll see on who, and from who.\n\nBugs:\n- In luckperms the permission \"swagsmp.pvp.overwrite.spy\" does not show up, no idea if I can fix this.", "created_at": "2023-08-21T21:39:14Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "49d5e4887a54ea51c7085e8486ab2b69e4060392", "message": ":sparkles: :question: PvP - Needs Testing\n\nAdded:\n- PvP Overwrite (player)\n-- This will set both player's PvP rule to true\n\n--TESTING NEEDED--\n- PvP Event\n-- Whenever 1 or both players have the PvP set to disable, it should not harm.\n\nprobably some other stuff? idk i forgor", "created_at": "2023-08-21T21:25:43Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "537657ad26d8948740894126d242e86f7109031d", "message": ":sparkles: File Mangement + Part of PvP Settings\n\nI have created a file mangement system, which allows you to save all kinds of data for every user.\nA file get's created PER USER, so everyone has their different file. It's in YML format, so it's easy to tweak manually, although some settings may get automatically changed on login, leaving or on command run.\n\nFurther I have made a PvP toggle, which does not yet do anything other than setting the pvpStatus data to on/off, this will be implemented in the near future.", "created_at": "2023-08-21T14:00:11Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "412a7a99884229b4f4bb1dbd0ee1aa07a533c4b8", "message": ":coffin:\nMore info on emoji use on github: https://gitmoji.dev", "created_at": "2023-08-19T23:48:47Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "097e4d3691d3c8c1be358b8b201a37736e38587a", "message": ":rocket: test\n\nMore info on emoji use on github: https://gitmoji.dev", "created_at": "2023-08-19T23:43:54Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ae548d7f0f108eaa1c167b3d08c152a957fd07b2", "message": ":art: File Organization\n\nFor more information on emoji usage on github, check out: https://gitmoji.dev", "created_at": "2023-08-19T23:41:07Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1426501a1546ca2c9f62a8d47e288c874f8c6eea", "message": "Update issue templates", "created_at": "2023-08-11T19:25:33Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7872b4cbdc15f2b0532eef26e0c08f7083adb5ca", "message": "Delete .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE directory", "created_at": "2023-08-11T15:01:28Z", "repo": "SwagSMP", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ac95f6b5e1e6479006b41d4bfd